				<wikidot:authorName>DeltaThree</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6974566</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>SCP-2806 is my number one, and I am also intrigued by SCP-2878 coming at the same concept from the opposite angle.</p> <p>I'd also like to take this opportunity to say I like SCP-777-J and SCP-10101-J even though they are jokes and are supposed to be examples of bad writing, I totally get that BUT&#8230;can somebody please animate their fight?!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
