					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13841601#post-4818607</guid>
				<title>Re: What are your two favorite articles on the SCP wiki?</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13841601/what-are-your-two-favorite-articles-on-the-scp-wiki#post-4818607</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2020 22:43:04 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>YellowISlol</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6284593</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>My favorite article on-site would have to be <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5375">SCP-5375</a> - &quot;Nobody and the Name Machine&quot; The whole thing appealed to me, and as such, it is my favorite.</p> <p>For second, that's tricky, but I would have to go with <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5160">SCP-5160</a> - &quot;Grandma Sheep believes in you!&quot; Simple article, nice and short, loved it!</p> <p>I would recommend both of these articles. Both are high quality and engaging to read through.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
